/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2013 StTriggerData2013

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 13 (year 2013) trigger data.

\section sec2013_overview Overview

StTriggerData2013 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 13 (year 2013)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2013 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2013.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2012, Run 13 adds MXQ crate slot access, MTD 3rd/4th-generation
board readout, and TF201 TOF DSM channel access.

\section sec2013_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2013
\endcode

\section sec2013_runyear Run Year
Run 13, calendar year 2013 &mdash; p+p collisions at &radic;s = 510 GeV.

\section sec2013_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2013* | Pointer to the raw Run 13 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2013* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2013* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2013* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mBC1[11]…mQT4[11] | various block pointers | Per-crossing crate sub-blocks (transient). |

\section sec2013_new New Compared to 2012

- mxqAtSlotAddress(int address, int prepost=0, int slot=0) &mdash; MXQ crate slot readout.
- mtd3AtAddress(int address, int prepost=0) &mdash; MTD 3rd-gen board value.
- mtd4AtAddress(int address, int prepost=0) &mdash; MTD 4th-gen board value.
- dsmTF201Ch(int ch) &mdash; TF201 TOF DSM channel.

\section sec2013_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short mtd3    = trgData->mtd3AtAddress(0, 0);
    unsigned short mxqSlot = trgData->mxqAtSlotAddress(0, 0, 2);
    unsigned short tf201   = trgData->dsmTF201Ch(3);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2012
\see StTriggerData2016
*/
